  "runningCoachCaptureTreadmillStepFrame": "Keep the head, both hands, both knees, and both shoes inside the frame for every step. Leave a little space above the head and below the belt.",
  "runningCoachCaptureTreadmillStepClip": "Record 5-10 seconds at a steady speed. Use 1080p/60 fps when available; 30 fps is the minimum.",
  "runningCoachCaptureOutdoorTitle": "Fixed side-pass setup",
